+/*
+ * selector 6, IOMobileFramebufferSwapWait(swap id) (0216). 0 = the swap is complete: its frame was latched by the MDP and
+ * the surfaces it replaced are free again. Anything else (kIOReturnTimeout) = still pending; CoreAnimation then asks
+ * again every 100 us until its own timeout (swap_wait_timeout), so waiting here for up to a frame only saves it
